the cure to reclaim humanity.","detailedDescription":"The world has fallen to the undead. But hope isn't lost — after years of research, brave scientists have discovered an antidote that can reverse zombification. The result? Zombie-human hybrids called humbies. Your mission: build a cutting-edge lab, cure the infected, and lead humanity back from the brink.\n\nBuild & Expand\n\nRaise walls and fences to protect your scientists. Set up production lines to process materials, generate power, and support your growing facility. Efficient planning is key — every machine, room, and cable counts.\n\nManage & Optimize\n\nAssign workers, prioritize tasks, and balance resources across day and night shifts. With four different worker types to manage, you’ll need smart planning to keep your lab running — and safe.\n\nResearch & Upgrade\n\nUnlock over 200 technologies to advance through four tech tiers. Discover high-tier materials, develop advanced science equipment, and push closer to the final cure.\n\nCapture & Cure\n\nUse high-tech freezing guns to catch zombies and bring them in for treatment. Watch them transform into humbies — helpful hybrids ready to work. But be careful: neglect their needs, and they might rampage through your lab.\n\nDefend & Survive\n\nEach night brings waves of zombies. Build smart defenses, electrify your perimeter, and keep the hordes at bay. But beware: one blackout can undo everything.\n\nCure the World\n\nHealing, not killing, is your path forward. Grow your workforce, manage their moods, and turn the tide of the apocalypse — one humbie at a time.\n\nKey Features\n\n• \nResearch and unlock 200+ technologie\n\n• \nGather resources and process them to fuel your economy\n\n• \nDesign and optimize your lab layout\n\n• \nBuild a complex, sustainable economy\n\n• \nManage power systems and avoid blackouts\n\n• \nControl four worker types across day/night shifts\n\n• \nKeep humbies happy to prevent outbreaks\n\n• \nBuild clever defenses to survive nightly zombie attacks\n\n• \nCure the undead and reclaim the world with science","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/925ded71b24a2a4e10015149e090b3aa5f3a26d1/header.jpg?t=1748412639"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/7afdbb264ca5cc9eea9bf7301ad1bc94290668d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748412639"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/93e28b51cfec4835e52e6b8013fa73f1d90ac5a8/ss_93e28b51cfec4835e52e6b8013fa73f1d90ac5a8.600x338.jpg?t=1748412639","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/93e28b51cfec4835e52e6b8013fa73f1d90ac5a8/ss_93e28b51cfec4835e52e6b8013fa73f1d90ac5a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748412639"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/01bbb80071a844ca3cee37a126edfaad17965848/ss_01bbb80071a844ca3cee37a126edfaad17965848.600x338.jpg?t=1748412639","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/01bbb80071a844ca3cee37a126edfaad17965848/ss_01bbb80071a844ca3cee37a126edfaad17965848.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748412639"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/6432ffa38f53e1caaaed135869901a7c8a21de32/ss_6432ffa38f53e1caaaed135869901a7c8a21de32.600x338.jpg?t=1748412639","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/6432ffa38f53e1caaaed135869901a7c8a21de32/ss_6432ffa38f53e1caaaed135869901a7c8a21de32.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748412639"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1620290/ss_1ab324faa48336f54f9c68ca3ffad6819047e16d.600x338.jpg?t=1748412639","url":"https://sh